bove or below the season's mean in proportion to the other league's clubs; within its league a club stands (W% − ½ − f × Δ) ÷ ((1 − f) × n/(n − 1) + f) above its league's mean, f the share of its league's games that were interleague and n the clubs of its league; m 0.0247, the win share a point of strength is worth in the engine under 2007's rules. Every player of the club moves by one whole number and the best few of its lineup by one more, so nobody passes a teammate.","licence":"WAR: JEFFBAGWELL (Neil Paine), MIT. Names, birthplaces, clubs and ballparks: the Baseball Databank (Chadwick Baseball Bureau), CC BY-SA 3.0; its home games from Retrosheet. See public/baseball/ATTRIBUTION.txt.","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Neil-Paine-1/MLB-WAR-data-historical/1c8c3084d62112efdaa7054125af3cd01003e38d/jeffbagwell_war_historical_2025.csv","retrieved":"2026-11-10","rawScale":"WAR"},"map":"mlb2006","nations":{"124":[69,20,[["Russell Martin","C",86],["Pete LaForest","C",65],["Justin Morneau","1B",78],["Matt Stairs","1B/LF/RF",75],["Joey Votto","1B/LF",65],["Scott Thorman","1B/LF",64],["Pete Orr","3B/2B/LF",64],["Jason Bay","LF/CF",78],["Adam Stern","CF/LF/RF",59],["Erik Bedard","SP",86],["Jeff Francis","SP",81],["Rich Harden","SP",81],["Shawn Hill","SP",77],["Adam Loewen","SP",69],["Ryan Dempster","RP",76],["Eric Gagne","RP",74],["Rheal Cormier","RP",72],["Jesse Crain","RP",71],["Ryan Braun","RP",64],["Dave Davidson","RP",57]]],"158":[53,4,[["Chin-lung Hu","SS",64],["Chien-Ming Wang","SP",83],["Hung-Chih Kuo","RP",67],["Chin-hui Tsao","RP",64]]],"170":[51,2,[["Orlando Cabrera","SS",83],["Edgar Renteria","SS",80]]],"192":[57,8,[["Brayan Pena","C",60],["Kendrys Morales","1B/RF",69],["Yuniesky Betancourt","SS/2B",79],["Yunel Escobar","SS/2B/3B",73],["Jose Contreras","SP",77],["Livan Hernandez","SP",76],["Orlando Hernandez","SP",75],["Danys Baez","RP",69]]],"214":[86,26,[["Ronny Paulino","C",76],["Miguel Olivo","C/1B",72],["Albert Pujols","1B",96],["David Ortiz","1B",91